@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:9000
@account = debug_user_20260827
@password = DebugPassword123!
@nickname = 调试用户

### 健康检查：预期返回 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
Accept: application/json

### 注册用户：首次执行预期返回 201；若账号已存在则修改 @account 后重试
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "account": "{{account}}",
  "password": "{{password}}",
  "nickname": "{{nickname}}"
}

### 用户登录：使用上方已注册的账号，预期返回 200 和 access_token
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login/password
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "account": "{{account}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### 重复注册：在账号已注册后执行，预期返回 409
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "account": "{{account}}",
  "password": "{{password}}",
  "nickname": "{{nickname}}"
}

### 错误密码登录：预期返回 401
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login/password
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "account": "{{account}}",
  "password": "wrong-password"
}

### 缺少必填字段：预期返回 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "account": "{{account}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}
